# scenario: retry-exhausted
# doc: retry-exhausted.md
# given: invoked as `claudine compose --claude retry-exhausted.md` from the directory holding the fixture documents
# given: every launch exits 1 with no result
# given: failure returns retry with one extra attempt; the second failure finds the budget spent
event initialize
event start
work fresh 1
event failure
err provider.exited
event start
work fresh 1
event failure
err provider.exited
event finalize
err provider.exited
exit 1
